{"id": "bernini-chained-apg", "name": "Bernini chained multi-condition guidance", "family": "guidance", "subfamily": "multi-arm", "plain": "A chain of guidance arms, each compared with the previous one, instead of all compared with one uncond. Each delta can be APG-projected. In the T8 port the rv2v branch uses plain deltas even though the upstream mode has APG in its name, per the comment there.", "math": "x\u0302=b+\u03c9_i P(s\u2212b, s)+\u03c9_t P(t\u2212s, t)+\u03c9_g P(g\u2212t, g).\nP(d,r)=.2 d\u2225+1.0 d\u22a5 with respect to r over all dims of a batch item.\nRv2v: x\u0302=b+\u03c9_v(v\u2212b)+\u03c9_i(i\u2212v)+\u03c9_t(t\u2212i)+\u03c9_g(g\u2212t). In velocity space; Comfy denoised is converted.\nBerniniR: result=u+\u03a3 s_i\u00b7APG(c_i\u2212c_{i\u22121}, c_i) with momentum and threshold per arm.", "props": {"hook": "guider", "extra_model_calls": "arms\u22121 extra", "params": "omega_video,omega_image,omega_text,omega_target"}, "evidence": [{"where": "T8mars__comfyui-bernini-v2-T8/bernini_v2/guidance.py:81", "symbol": "compose_velocity_guidance"}, {"where": "T8mars__comfyui-bernini-v2-T8/bernini_v2/guidance.py:45", "symbol": "apg_delta"}, {"where": "neuregex__ComfyUI-BerniniR/bernini/guidance.py:54", "symbol": "normalized_guidance_chain"}], "providers": [{"pack": "T8mars__comfyui-bernini-v2-T8", "author": "T8mars", "licence": "Apache-2.0", "kind": "original", "nodes": ["BerniniV2Guider", "BerniniV2RendererGuider"], "note": "", "verdict": "TRY", "risks": ["patches torch or ComfyUI globally", "downloads models"], "res4lyf": false}, {"pack": "neuregex__ComfyUI-BerniniR", "author": "neuregex", "licence": "Apache-2.0", "kind": "variant", "nodes": ["BerniniRGuiderNode"], "note": "Chain with momentum buffers", "verdict": "TRY", "risks": ["installs software at runtime", "downloads models"], "res4lyf": false}], "providers_n": 2, "in_core": false, "live": false, "needs_pack": true, "core_ref": {}, "family_fit": [{"family": "Bernini", "why": "written for this mode